{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30643","headline":"和徐先辈秋日游泾州南亭呈三二同年 · 姚鹄","name":"和徐先辈秋日游泾州南亭呈三二同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多此欢情泛鷁舟，桂枝同折塞同游。\n声喧岛上巢松鹤，影落杯中过水鸥。\n送日暮钟交戍岭，呌云寒角动城楼。\n酒酣笑语秋风里，谁道槐花更起愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}